abstract: >-
  Raw answers and derived tables from asking LLM APIs with web search (OpenAI API gpt-5-mini-2025-08-07,
  Anthropic API claude-haiku-5-5) the same unbranded buying questions in five US B2B software categories,
  twice each. API answers can differ from the ChatGPT and Claude apps.
